Invincea Labs is pleased to announce the release of V3SPA v2.1.1:
https://github.com/invincealabs/V3SPA/releases/tag/v2.1.1

V3SPA is an open source GUI and interactive visualization tool for
analyzing, exploring, and diffing the allow rules of SELinux and SE for
Android security policies. V3SPA is capable of importing binary policies,
via a dependency on SETools v4, as well as Reference Policy source, via a
dependency on Lobster.

For an overview of V3SPA's user interface, see our blog post:
https://www.invincealabs.com/blog/2016/12/v3spa-announcement/

You can download and setup V3SPA from the Github repo:
https://github.com/invincealabs/V3SPA

Lobster automatically installs with V3SPA, but it can also be installed
separately if you wish to use it as a standalone tool:
https://github.com/invincealabs/lobster/


Robert Gove
Invincea Labs

